<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 572.06, down 0.38.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 324 to 240.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,472,940 compared with 23,127,210 Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
